{"nodes": [{"id": "fric_pandacodegen_fric_proposal_document", "label": "PandaCodeGen FRIC Proposal & Delivery Plan (client-facing PDF): 'Building the platform for FRIC's next decade' \u2014 a response to the FRIC Website Content, Design & Technical Specification v1.0, prepared for Anas Iqbal and Paul Fu, 22 Jul 2026, Confidential", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "fric/PandaCodeGen_FRIC_Proposal.pdf", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Hassan", "contributor": "PandaCodeGen"}, {"id": "fric_website_content_design_technical_specification_formatted_fric_company", "label": "FRIC (Guangzhou) Advertising Products Co., Ltd \u2014 est. 1996, 150+ technical staff, 5,000 sqm Guangzhou facility, clients incl. Unilever/L'Or\u00e9al/Pepsi/Heineken/Sony/Disney, certified EcoVadis/ICTI/Sedex/EN71", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "fric/PandaCodeGen_FRIC_Proposal.pdf", "source_location": "Our Understanding", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "fric_website_content_design_technical_specification_formatted_anas_iqbal", "label": "Anas Iqbal \u2014 Procurement Manager, FRIC (proposal addressee, named single-approver / buying-centre approver)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "fric/PandaCodeGen_FRIC_Proposal.pdf", "source_location": "cover page", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "fric_website_content_design_technical_specification_formatted_paul_fu", "label": "Paul Fu \u2014 General Manager, FRIC (proposal addressee, named single-approver / buying-centre approver)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "fric/PandaCodeGen_FRIC_Proposal.pdf", "source_location": "cover page", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "fric_pandacodegen_fric_proposal_note_before_we_begin", "label": "'A Note Before We Begin' cover letter as delivered, addressed to Anas and Paul, signed by Hassan: 'Thank you for one of the most considered briefs we have ever received... The distance between the company you are and the company your site describes is precisely the distance this project closes'", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "fric/PandaCodeGen_FRIC_Proposal.pdf", "source_location": "p.02", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "fric_pandacodegen_fric_proposal_executive_summary", "label": "Executive Summary \u2014 'The instrument of a repositioning' (reading of spec \u00a703): Need/Solution/Outcome/Why-Us four-part framing; 'The website's job is to make FRIC understood by a senior visitor, trusted by a buying committee, and discoverable by the systems, human and machine, that now shape a shortlist'", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "fric/PandaCodeGen_FRIC_Proposal.pdf", "source_location": "\u00a701 p.03", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "fric_pandacodegen_fric_proposal_our_understanding", "label": "Our Understanding \u2014 who FRIC is and where it's going: company today (1996, Fortune-500 roster, 150+ staff, 5,000sqm, EcoVadis/ICTI/Sedex/EN71), the direction (requirement accuracy over supply scale), who actually decides (senior approver + operational evaluator), the gap/opportunity; single design implication = every major page self-sufficient", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "fric/PandaCodeGen_FRIC_Proposal.pdf", "source_location": "\u00a702 p.04", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "fric_pandacodegen_fric_proposal_current_state_analysis", "label": "Current-State Analysis \u2014 'Where the site stands today' (in the spirit of spec \u00a717): dimension table (Front-end/Rendering/Performance/Content system/Discoverability/Design ceiling) comparing gzfric.com today vs brief requirements; 'the current site is not broken... but cannot deliver the performance, AI-search readiness, content system or premium design the brief now demands. This is a rebuild, not a redesign'", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "fric/PandaCodeGen_FRIC_Proposal.pdf", "source_location": "\u00a703 p.05", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "fric_pandacodegen_fric_proposal_strategic_approach", "label": "Strategic Approach \u2014 three structural commitments: (1) Every page is an entry page, (2) A narrative that earns each scroll, (3) A connected knowledge system; primary navigation box restated", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "fric/PandaCodeGen_FRIC_Proposal.pdf", "source_location": "\u00a704 p.06", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "fric_pandacodegen_fric_proposal_page_architecture", "label": "Page Architecture \u2014 page-family/job/primary-conversion table: Home, Who We Are, What We Build\u00d77, Industries\u00d74, Insights, Proof assets, Contact; Commercial Observation flagged as FRIC's signature format", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "fric/PandaCodeGen_FRIC_Proposal.pdf", "source_location": "\u00a705 p.07", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "fric_pandacodegen_fric_proposal_technology_architecture", "label": "Technology & Architecture \u2014 'A modern, owned foundation' (brief asks in \u00a734 and \u00a740): Next.js App Router SSR/SSG, Sanity headless CMS, Vercel edge hosting, discoverability built into templates; ownership/no-lock-in commitments (FRIC owns 100% code/tokens/content, portable Sanity content, transparent recurring costs, complete handover)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "fric/PandaCodeGen_FRIC_Proposal.pdf", "source_location": "\u00a706 p.08", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "fric_pandacodegen_fric_proposal_design_approach", "label": "Design Approach \u2014 'The white-portal system' (register described in spec \u00a732): visual 